{
    "version": 6,
    "bundle": "QMUQANVZNJDZEUUX5QV6HZNYI4BJC66R",
    "type": "story",
    "storyId": "041133003",
    "title": "第3章 歴史の持つ“引力”",
    "enTitle": "Chapter 3: The Allure of History",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "私の母は、年代学者で……家に、立派な書斎を持っていました。\nそこには、種々様々な『歴史の本』があって――",
            "enText": "My mother is a chronologist… so we had a magnificent study \nat home. There were all sorts of books on history there.",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 337,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 390,
                    "pathId": -1371757574274953098
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 206,
                    "pathId": -8049062107631394370
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8618164678593611818,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "まだ幼い頃、私がとりわけ夢中になったのは……\nウマ娘たちの『レース史』でした。",
            "enText": "When I was still young, what I became especially obsessed \nwith was… the racing history of horsegirls.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 250,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 375,
                    "pathId": 2184167253368069023
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 21,
                    "pathId": -7380918225327312665
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3884148934121770529,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "レース史には、深いドラマがあった……それも、その娘個人で\n完結するものではない――紡がれた歴史、その上にあるドラマが。",
            "enText": "Racing history was profoundly sentimental… and it wasn't \nsomething that began and ended with an individual — it was \nfull of interwoven stories charged with emotion.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 399,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 33,
                    "pathId": 5387294420005860712
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -7426811592053694077,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "……どうしようもなく、わくわくしました。過去を知れば\n知るほど大きくなっていく、その壮大な“絵巻物”に。",
            "enText": "I couldn't help but be excited… by that grand \"illustrated scroll\" \nthat only grew larger the more I learned about its past.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 307,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 318,
                    "pathId": -1165881799965752524
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3777731647255008087,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "歴史とは“絵”です。レースに携わる全ての者たちが描いた数多の\n“点”が繋がり、線になることで浮かび上がる――巨大な一枚絵。",
            "enText": "History is much like those illustrations. Countless dots drawn \nby all those involved in racing, connecting to form lines from \nwhich a single, massive image emerges.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 360,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 371,
                    "pathId": -87070816505868941
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4949463843621738655,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "シンボリルドルフは輝かしい点を記しました。けれどその先に――\nトウカイテイオーが。連なる彼女たちがいることで、絵は完成した。",
            "enText": "Symboli Rudolf marked a brilliant dot. But after her \ncame Tokai Teio and others. Through their connections, \none illustration began took shape.",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 425,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 467,
                    "pathId": 8179118572328534973
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 185,
                    "pathId": 4464765633676568542
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 173,
                    "pathId": -4570866055675540814
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": -3354667687780551603
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 156,
                    "pathId": 3818372023472482563
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3295480142912363586,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "スペシャルウィーク、グラスワンダー、エルコンドルパサー……\nあの世代の誰が欠けても、あそこまで美しい絵にはならなかった。",
            "enText": "Special Week, Grass Wonder, El Condor Pasa… \nIf any of them were missing, their generation's \nillustration wouldn't have ended up as beautiful.",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 349,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 467,
                    "pathId": 7409263675576047465
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 417,
                    "pathId": -3323597292717214398
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 14,
                    "pathId": -5299820908946348653
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 14,
                    "pathId": -1333783315665222202
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 201,
                    "pathId": -8598068385060255767
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 351,
                    "pathId": 7811607827325463664
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 247,
                    "pathId": -429154814315001102
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8245377744353415710,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "……それらの事実に気づいた時にはもう、私は……\n魅入られていました。歴史に。そして――",
            "enText": "…When I realized the stories they told were very real, \nI was… captivated. By this history, and…",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "origClipLength": 362,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 364,
                    "pathId": 3285970987947127464
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 16,
                    "pathId": -500019958613568195
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 15,
                    "pathId": -4216496700177301663
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 15,
                    "pathId": 2951975037202414307
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 247,
                    "pathId": -2301671443103179456
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2962714606382872428,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "その絵の中に、いたいと思いました。",
            "enText": "I wanted to be part of those illustrations.",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 105,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 158,
                    "pathId": 4301011389774508806
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6139251696441227806,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "グランちゃん、ラヴちゃんはこれから、点を描きます。\n私も、そうしたいけど……。",
            "enText": "Gran and Love will be drawing their dots from here on out. \nI want to do the same, but…",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 283,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 333,
                    "pathId": -5714625142784104869
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 86,
                    "pathId": 35007600978128352
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 129,
                    "pathId": -8899971582284656948
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 340,
                    "pathId": -6470464818061144327
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 226,
                    "pathId": 8532650338983852567
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6021070795662153433,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "まだ、足りない。全然。歴史を紡いできた先達に……\nこれから紡ぐであろう彼女たちに。",
            "enText": "I'm still lacking. Completely. Compared to our predecessors \nwho have woven our history… and compared to the girls who \nwill weave it from now on.",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 317,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 399,
                    "pathId": 5506057803095036461
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 50,
                    "pathId": 6610724339722407824
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 129,
                    "pathId": -7251541218474691440
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 340,
                    "pathId": -5646424681981600162
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 15,
                    "pathId": -6345984965468626101
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 8840945748160064884,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "……それが、嫌なんです。\n足りない自分を許してはいけない。だって――",
            "enText": "…And I hate that. I can't forgive myself for lacking. Because…",
            "nextBlock": 13,
            "origClipLength": 268,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 164,
                    "pathId": -271717242444751200
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 196,
                    "pathId": 852697830116514026
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -408611422802461435,
            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "そんな歴史を紡ぎたいんです、私も。",
            "enText": "I want to weave this history with them.",
            "nextBlock": 14,
            "origClipLength": 123,
            "voiceIdx": 12,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 172,
                    "pathId": -3497398865221120418
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 188,
                    "pathId": 8311906374954073008
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 8674078433693573897,
            "blockIdx": 13
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "――あの頃の私のような誰かを、わくわくさせたい。\nそう、思っていて……。",
            "enText": "I want to make someone feel as excited as I was back then. \nThat's what I've been thinking…",
            "nextBlock": 15,
            "origClipLength": 212,
            "voiceIdx": 13,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 206,
                    "pathId": 267032270427591158
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 247,
                    "pathId": -3911372103205534880
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6893392116219192182,
            "blockIdx": 14
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "…………あっ。す、すみませんっ……！\n一人で、長々と……。",
            "enText": "……Ah. I-I'm sorry…! Rambling on all by myself…",
            "nextBlock": 16,
            "origClipLength": 150,
            "voiceIdx": 14,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "いや。……話してくれてありがとう",
                    "enText": "Not at all… Thank you for sharing.",
                    "nextBlock": 16
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "ううん。……話してくれてありがとう",
                    "enText": "No… Thank you for sharing.",
                    "nextBlock": 16
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 129,
                    "pathId": -4255487640421186938
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -3979233950875050526
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6596852800976607741,
            "blockIdx": 15
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "彼女が根を詰める理由がわかった。――夢があるから。\nそのために、努力を惜しみたくないようだ。",
            "enText": "I understood now why she was pushing herself so hard. \nShe had a dream… and wasn't about to spare any effort \nto achieve it.",
            "nextBlock": 17,
            "origClipLength": 105,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 230,
                    "pathId": -5194716832202303927
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 191,
                    "pathId": 4695464297872913767
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2207524625439084271,
            "blockIdx": 16
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "……もちろん、大言壮語だって、\nわかってはいるんですけど……。",
            "enText": "…Of course, I know I'm talking big, but…",
            "nextBlock": 18,
            "origClipLength": 183,
            "voiceIdx": 15,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "そんなことないよ。――そんなことない",
                    "enText": "That's not true at all… Not at all.",
                    "nextBlock": 18
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 205,
                    "pathId": 5850201054390575860
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 118,
                    "pathId": -3666456437587546240
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1863976724670060923,
            "blockIdx": 17
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "……トレーナーさん。",
            "enText": "……Trainer.",
            "nextBlock": 19,
            "origClipLength": 137,
            "voiceIdx": 16,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 89,
                    "pathId": -3573864716775984441
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 3912344468898609289
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4918906749574142033,
            "blockIdx": 18
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "だって現に自分は、模擬レースで“もったいない”と思った。\n何かが変わるだけで、彼女は大物になれる――そんな確信がある。",
            "enText": "Because I actually felt it was such a shame when I watched her \nin the practice race. With the slightest of changes, she could \nbecome a huge star. I was certain of it.",
            "nextBlock": 20,
            "origClipLength": 121,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 199,
                    "pathId": -2101481452550578266
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4099182381589534253,
            "blockIdx": 19
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "……その。実は2週間後に、トレセン学園見学会というのがあって。\nレースファンの方々を招いて行うイベントなのですが……。",
            "enText": "…Umm. Actually, in two weeks, there will be an Open Day \nhere at Tracen Academy, where we invite racing fans…",
            "nextBlock": 21,
            "origClipLength": 381,
            "voiceIdx": 17,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 364,
                    "pathId": -4563911675933115222
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 168,
                    "pathId": -785985137256655312
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -690401539961333988,
            "blockIdx": 20
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "そこで行われるイベントレースに出走するんです。\nだから、下手な走りはしたくなくて……。",
            "enText": "I'll be running in the event race held there. \nSo, I don't want to show a poor performance…",
            "nextBlock": 22,
            "origClipLength": 258,
            "voiceIdx": 18,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "そっか、だから……",
                    "enText": "Ah, so that's why…",
                    "nextBlock": 22
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 249,
                    "pathId": 5699325969473387217
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 151,
                    "pathId": -8148766823653094588
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 539867229174313932,
            "blockIdx": 21
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "……夢の話を聞いて、彼女の熱意を知って。\nそうしたら自然と、言葉が口から零れていた。",
            "enText": "After hearing about her dream and seeing her passion, \nthe words naturally spilled from my lips…",
            "nextBlock": 23,
            "origClipLength": 99,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "よかったら、俺にも手伝わせてくれない？",
                    "enText": "If you don't mind, could I help you out?",
                    "nextBlock": 23
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "よかったら、私にも手伝わせてくれない？",
                    "enText": "Would you be alright with me helping?",
                    "nextBlock": 23
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 364,
                    "pathId": -2145084497705366610
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 147,
                    "pathId": 297713856297182730
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1838341907356178913,
            "blockIdx": 22
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "後日、クロノジェネシスにお願いし、過去のレース映像を何個か\n見させてもらう。……彼女はどのレースも思案げな顔で走っていた。",
            "enText": "A few days later, I asked Chrono Genesis to show me \nsome of her past race footage. …In every race, she ran \nwith a pensive expression.",
            "nextBlock": 24,
            "origClipLength": 124,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 14,
                    "pathId": 6049511337321918059
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 14,
                    "pathId": -3035411653944829694
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 135,
                    "pathId": 3885312169252857700
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5550408307672306548,
            "blockIdx": 23
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "こっちは、『阪神ジュベナイルフィリーズ』……\nブエナビスタさんが勝ったレースを参考に、位置取りをしました。",
            "enText": "This one is the Hanshin Juvenile Fillies… \nI positioned myself based on the race Buena Vista won.",
            "nextBlock": 25,
            "origClipLength": 255,
            "voiceIdx": 19,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "内にもスペースがあるけど、そこには？",
                    "enText": "There was space on the inside too, \nwhy didn't you take that?",
                    "nextBlock": 25
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 447,
                    "pathId": 1615670943129463160
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5503095097641618762,
            "blockIdx": 24
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "……正直、迷いました。ブエナさんの翌年は、内から差した\nウマ娘が勝ったので。どちらを参考にすべきか……。",
            "enText": "…Honestly, I was torn. The year after Buena, \na horsegirl who charged from the inside won. \nSo I wondered which one I should reference…",
            "nextBlock": 26,
            "origClipLength": 357,
            "voiceIdx": 20,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 447,
                    "pathId": 2552698138104350689
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -879095264380265314,
            "blockIdx": 25
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "でも、そのまま外から。内を走る8番が、過去の模擬レースを\n観ても、よれる傾向にある娘でしたから。ここは勝つために――",
            "enText": "But I stayed on the outside. Looking at past practice races, \nnumber eight running on the inside had a tendency to drift. \nTo win here, I had to ——",
            "nextBlock": 27,
            "origClipLength": 334,
            "voiceIdx": 21,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "……いつもそんなに考えながら走ってるの？",
                    "enText": "…Do you always think this much while running?",
                    "nextBlock": 27
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 440,
                    "pathId": -1403931455382411760
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 436,
                    "pathId": -5356703689220326661
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 14,
                    "pathId": -3785881353078644762
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8958300795077504223,
            "blockIdx": 26
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "はい。歴史は“すでにある事実”なので……\nそれを利用しない手はないと思いますから……。",
            "enText": "Yes. History is \"established fact\"… so I think \nit'd be a waste not to utilize it…",
            "nextBlock": 28,
            "origClipLength": 225,
            "voiceIdx": 22,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "なるほど……",
                    "enText": "I see…",
                    "nextBlock": 28
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 278,
                    "pathId": 819469902468585441
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": -7453931631025104650
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -729645966432835579,
            "blockIdx": 27
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "クロノジェネシスの解説とともに、彼女のレースを\n観て気づいたことがあった。それは――",
            "enText": "Watching Chrono Genesis' races along with \nher commentary, I realized something…",
            "nextBlock": 29,
            "origClipLength": 99,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "レース中、考えすぎてるかも！",
                    "enText": "<size=34>You might be overthinking things during the race!</size>",
                    "nextBlock": 29
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 377,
                    "pathId": 304885462788378067
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3255115346455357464,
            "blockIdx": 28
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "か、考えすぎ、ですか……？",
            "enText": "O-Overthinking, you say…?",
            "nextBlock": 30,
            "origClipLength": 87,
            "voiceIdx": 23,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 121,
                    "pathId": -8932067371838334849
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 204,
                    "pathId": 4861895246474109870
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3702679219958899018,
            "blockIdx": 29
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "レース史に造詣が深いのは彼女の武器ではある。だけど――それを\n参照しようとしすぎるあまり、頭でっかちになっている印象だ。",
            "enText": "Her deep knowledge of racing history is her weapon. \nBut she tries so hard to reference it that it gives the \nimpression she's getting too stuck in her own head.",
            "nextBlock": 31,
            "origClipLength": 123,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "もっと、何も考えずに！自由に走ろう！",
                    "enText": "<size=38>Stop thinking so much! Just run freely!</size>",
                    "nextBlock": 31
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -747086784950107813
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -8743761679573848015
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1378655523158147413,
            "blockIdx": 30
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "な、なるほど……自由に、ですね。\nはい、意識してみます……！",
            "enText": "I-I see… freely. Yes, I'll try to keep that in mind…!",
            "nextBlock": 32,
            "origClipLength": 246,
            "voiceIdx": 24,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 50,
                    "pathId": -5252810508491501357
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -8946089663654451031
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5893721845704427582,
            "blockIdx": 31
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "（歴史を参照しない、私らしい走り……\n自由に……なにも考えずに――）",
            "enText": "(Running in a way that doesn't reference history, \na way uniquely mine… freely… without thinking \nabout anything…)",
            "nextBlock": 33,
            "origClipLength": 240,
            "voiceIdx": 25,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 15,
                    "pathId": 2094664393509223921
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 339,
                    "pathId": -2121609687362938964
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 639059872974841590,
            "blockIdx": 32
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "はあああああーーーーーっっっっ！！！",
            "enText": "<i>Haaaaaaahhhhh!!!</i>",
            "nextBlock": 34,
            "origClipLength": 105,
            "voiceIdx": 26,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "こ、これは――！！",
                    "enText": "T-This is…!!",
                    "nextBlock": 34
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 125,
                    "pathId": 3108065657043403374
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 8070122905979649915
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8563702601756358236,
            "blockIdx": 33
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "息の上がったクロノジェネシスに『お疲れ様』と声をかける。\nそのあとで、さっきの走りについて感想を伝えた。",
            "enText": "Chrono Genesis was still out of breath as I called out \n\"Good work!\" to her. A little later, I shared my thoughts \non her running.",
            "nextBlock": 35,
            "origClipLength": 112,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "大逃げは、さすがに自由すぎるかも……！",
                    "enText": "A massive breakaway might be taking \"free\" a bit too far…!",
                    "nextBlock": 35
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 62,
                    "pathId": 2878088033968371549
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4943301045830458751,
            "blockIdx": 34
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "す、すみませんっ……！　とにかく自由に走ろうと考えていたら、\nいつの間にか、こんな……うう……。",
            "enText": "I-I'm sorry…! I was just thinking about running freely, \nand before I knew it, I ended up like this… <i>Uugh…</i>",
            "nextBlock": 36,
            "origClipLength": 323,
            "voiceIdx": 27,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 203,
                    "pathId": 7066462049060341304
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 112,
                    "pathId": 5813904474358742030
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7909367074979826852,
            "blockIdx": 35
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "これまで、歴史を参考に走ることばかりしてきたので……。\nなにも参照しないで、と言われると、その……。",
            "enText": "Up until now, I've only ever run by referencing history… \nSo when you tell me not to reference anything, well…",
            "nextBlock": 37,
            "origClipLength": 304,
            "voiceIdx": 28,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 225,
                    "pathId": -8339713556087210001
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 21,
                    "pathId": 4092118092068207999
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7632118493369138260,
            "blockIdx": 36
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "私らしい走りって、なんなのか……。",
            "enText": "I don't know what running in my own unique way \nis even supposed to be like…",
            "nextBlock": 38,
            "origClipLength": 111,
            "voiceIdx": 29,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "それを考えることもしなくていいと思うよ",
                    "enText": "<size=34>I don't think you really need to think about that</size>.",
                    "nextBlock": 38
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 142,
                    "pathId": -9095010644999860866
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 266,
                    "pathId": 2741550422085014937
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3201858176533687272,
            "blockIdx": 37
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "何を考えずとも、自然としている走り――それが『彼女の走り』\nのはず。だから本当に、“何も考えない”が大事なのだけど……。",
            "enText": "Running naturally without thinking about anything — that should \nallow her to run her own way. That's why it really is important \nto \"not think about anything\", but…",
            "nextBlock": 39,
            "origClipLength": 123,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 138,
                    "pathId": -2520546814765697478
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 21,
                    "pathId": 573328400464095948
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6788249676764336380,
            "blockIdx": 38
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "な、なるほど……私らしい走り、を意識しなくても……。\n…………。",
            "enText": "I-I see… So I don't even need to be conscious of it………",
            "nextBlock": 40,
            "origClipLength": 271,
            "voiceIdx": 30,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（まだ何か思案してる顔だな……）",
                    "enText": "<size=32>(She still looks like she's pondering over something…)</size>",
                    "nextBlock": 40
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "（まだ何か思案してる顔だね……）",
                    "enText": "<size=32>(She still looks like she's pondering over something…)</size>",
                    "nextBlock": 40
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 224,
                    "pathId": 2634893152360716694
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 16,
                    "pathId": -2702541833890735256
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1821581385438287139,
            "blockIdx": 39
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "結局『考えずに走ろう！』だけでは、問題解決の助言として\n足りていないのだろう。であれば、もっと有益なアドバイスを――",
            "enText": "In the end, just telling her \"Run without thinking!\" was always \nunlikely to be sufficient advice to help her work through this. \nI need to give her something more useful ——",
            "nextBlock": 41,
            "origClipLength": 120,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 196,
                    "pathId": 1260590529700567819
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1057271700878465271,
            "blockIdx": 40
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "……あげたいけれど、現状思いつけていない。――ならば、\nどうする？　歴史好きな彼女が求める答えを、探すとしたら……。",
            "enText": "…Well, I'd love to, but I can't think of anything right now. \nThen what should I do? Where could a history lover like her \nfind answers? The only thing that comes to mind is…",
            "nextBlock": 42,
            "origClipLength": 120,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "……ウマ娘ミュージアム、行ってみようか？",
                    "enText": "…Shall we go to the Horsegirl Museum?",
                    "nextBlock": 42
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "……ウマ娘ミュージアム、行ってみない？",
                    "enText": "…Want to go to the Horsegirl Museum?",
                    "nextBlock": 42
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 196,
                    "pathId": 35019359876493589
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5457963522898198084,
            "blockIdx": 41
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "クロノジェネシスは歴史とともに歩んできた。そんな彼女に、\nレース中は歴史を切り離せ、と望むのは難しい。なら――",
            "enText": "History has always been such a big part of her. \nIt's a hard ask for her to separate herself from \nit in the middle of a race now. So instead…",
            "nextBlock": 43,
            "origClipLength": 116,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "君にとって歴史とは何なのか、再考しよう",
                    "enText": "<size=40>Let's rethink what history means to you</size>.",
                    "nextBlock": 43
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "貴方にとって歴史とは何なのか、再考しよう",
                    "enText": "<size=40>Let's rethink what history means to you</size>.",
                    "nextBlock": 43
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 65,
                    "pathId": -8564326470451870757
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 126,
                    "pathId": 6481160774428988310
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 18,
                    "pathId": 8441527784454775915
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -45084758171247845,
            "blockIdx": 42
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "なるほどです……\n私にとって、歴史とは――あっ。",
            "enText": "I see now… What history means to me… Ah!",
            "nextBlock": 44,
            "origClipLength": 208,
            "voiceIdx": 31,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ん？何か見つけた？",
                    "enText": "Hmm? Think of something?",
                    "nextBlock": 44
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 167,
                    "pathId": -7891456782730555130
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 76,
                    "pathId": 5200540154526105213
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6886066303242090240,
            "blockIdx": 43
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "いえ、その……特別展示があったので、つい……。\nこの間は、そんなのなかったのに……。",
            "enText": "No, it's just… there's a special exhibit, so it caught \nmy eye… It wasn't here the last time…",
            "nextBlock": 45,
            "origClipLength": 261,
            "voiceIdx": 32,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "本当だ。ちょっと見てみようか？",
                    "enText": "You're right. Want to take a quick look?",
                    "nextBlock": 45
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 274,
                    "pathId": -7858596949978110083
