            "pathId": -6967252977016633619,
            "blockIdx": 45
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "『グランプリ連覇の軌跡』と銘打たれた、映像展示を観る。\nそこには、歴史に名を刻んだ名ウマ娘たちの姿があった――",
            "enText": "We watched the video exhibit titled \"The Path to Back-to-Back \nGrand Prix Victories\", which featured famous horsegirls who \nhad carved their names into history.",
